  speakerName: LITO
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueText: 'When asking someone to hand you an object, you can use ''ikanmo
    man...''


    It means ''give me...'' and you add the item you want afterward.


    For
    example, you can say ''ikanmo man...'' followed by the object you want.


    Now,
    ask for an object using ''ikanmo man...'' and complete the phrase with the object
    you want.'
